---
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Meadbee Labs, a personal AI and software laboratory focused on local AI, model training, autonomous agents, and generative tooling."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Lab profile / Working interests</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">About the Lab</h1>
        <p class="page-lede">
          Meadbee Labs is a personal AI and software laboratory: part developer portfolio, part
          technical notebook, part experiment archive, and part project repository.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="page-aside">
        <span class="mono-label">Profile boundary</span>
        <p>
          This page stays focused on supplied technical interests. Biographical details and
          contact information can be added later without inventing them now.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="section-index">01 / Purpose</p>
        <h2 id="about-title">A durable home for work in progress</h2>
        <p>
          The lab exists to document substantial systems and the smaller experiments that make
          those systems possible. It is designed to show how things are built—not only the final
          screenshots or release files.
        </p>
        <p>
          That includes architecture experiments, tokenizer and dataset work, model training,
          autonomous-agent runs, generative media workflows, local developer systems, and the
          failed tests that still produced useful lessons.
        </p>
        <p>
          The website itself follows the same principle: lightweight, content-driven, and easy
          to extend through Markdown or MDX rather than a bespoke publishing backend.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="section-index">02 / Technical interests</p>
        <ul class="interest-list">
          <li>Software development</li>
          <li>Local AI experimentation</li>
          <li>Language-model training</li>
          <li>Diffusion-model research</li>
          <li>Autonomous-agent systems</li>
          <li>Generative tools</li>
          <li>Creative development workflows</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compact rule-top" aria-labelledby="links-title">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeading
        headingId="links-title"
        index="03 / Public links"
        title="Follow the source work"
        description="These are the public locations supplied for the initial build. Additional project repositories and contact routes can be attached later."
      />
      <div class="card-grid two">
        <div class="link-panel">
          <h2>Development</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/jordanmckin" rel="me noreferrer">GitHub profile</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/jordanmckin/Yuna_130m_Colab" rel="noreferrer">Yuna training repository</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="link-panel">
          <h2>Models</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://huggingface.co/meadbee" rel="me noreferrer">Meadbee on Hugging Face</a></li>
            <li><a href="/models/">Model research index</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
